WEBVTT

00:01.040 --> 00:02.160
I previously

00:02.240 --> 00:03.880
Gave it to Eunuch Wen

00:03.960 --> 00:05.280
Didn't I tell you

00:05.360 --> 00:06.280
Unless it's for someone important

00:06.360 --> 00:07.760
Don't take it out?

00:08.360 --> 00:09.760
Ruo Lan

00:09.960 --> 00:11.360
Think of another way

00:11.760 --> 00:12.560
See if our household

00:12.640 --> 00:13.400
Has any other valuable gifts

00:13.480 --> 00:14.560
We can prepare

00:14.640 --> 00:15.920
You talk big

00:16.000 --> 00:17.200
But where's the money?

00:17.280 --> 00:18.200
This dynasty's taxes

00:18.280 --> 00:19.920
Are all collected by local officials themselves

00:20.000 --> 00:20.920
And kept by themselves

00:21.000 --> 00:23.320
Even the Emperor doesn't have much money

00:23.400 --> 00:25.400
And you're still supporting many people

00:27.760 --> 00:29.600
Then for now we can only

